{"title":"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 28","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of distinct pairs of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Integers\">integers</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adfd9ae8a3fac031d3b8b470a52a709a23d4d6d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/9/b4998bd67a4e233ee124b5483cdc785db57db5cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x&lt;y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/b/f1bb261d81177d6cbb203b8e39f00a4da3b34af9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{1984}=\\sqrt{x}+\\sqrt{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"148\" height=\"22\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/6/8569567feb25ae2cfe56d00e49cf68093d3cbe2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }0 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 3 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }4 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"342\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simplify <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/0/29014257808d0242cdf15ee2b3c68d284f940653.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{1984}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/a/4baa6ce155ae10cfc85c992ed6e00b88ad72d87c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8\\sqrt{31}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"42\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, the only solutions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/f/64fca690ff9724c77b83bb9c28734b4deed9a445.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\sqrt{31}+b\\sqrt{31}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"106\" height=\"18\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/8/f08679a65ff0607b390a9b3a853150f1f4290db3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/a/eaa9031768c2fb7d820d8b5f22c6cd2cc4c77d90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;a&lt;b$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"75\" height=\"13\" />. The only solutions to this are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/d/44d4fe98cced13d00b5d88685c8c4117690c4643.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1, b=7; a=2, b=6; a=3, b=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"292\" height=\"16\" />. Each of these gives distinct pairs of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adfd9ae8a3fac031d3b8b470a52a709a23d4d6d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" />, so there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> pairs, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/b/82b317654f901a9c8f56585721a617396d3b050c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME\" title=\"1984 AHSME\">1984 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1984 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1984\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•<